WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
READY: Driver receives the spotter's thumbs-up.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Spotter double-checks chocks and surrounding clearance.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
SAFE: Spotter confirms safety with a thumbs-up.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
GO: Driver returns a thumbs-up to the spotter.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Ring the warning bell three times before moving.

00:20.000 --> 00:28.000
Move slowly and smoothly toward the aircraft while maintaining eye contact with the spotter.
